1
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:46,900
"The Missing Piece"

2
00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:51,800
(Episode 15)

3
00:02:03,120 --> 00:02:03,760
Come on in

4
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:04,760
Shen Mo

5
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:06,879
Say hi to your Mr. Ji

6
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:12,840
Mr. Ji

7
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:16,400
We're fighting side by side

8
00:02:17,039 --> 00:02:18,039
Behave yourself

9
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:20,400
Ji Mingxuan

10
00:02:20,719 --> 00:02:22,800
If you want your Shen Mo to stay safe

11
00:02:23,159 --> 00:02:25,400
First, stop meddling in our family's project right now

12
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:26,400
Second

13
00:02:26,599 --> 00:02:27,800
All these years, what you owe our family

14
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:29,840
Give back all the assets and money

15
00:02:30,039 --> 00:02:31,039
And also

16
00:02:31,080 --> 00:02:33,439
You'll pay us mother and son for emotional damages

17
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:34,680
Is that clear

18
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:35,960
Okay, okay, okay

19
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:37,960
I'll give you everything

20
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:39,319
As long as you let Shen Mo go

21
00:02:39,319 --> 00:02:40,319
I'll give you all of it

22
00:02:41,919 --> 00:02:42,919
You'd better

23
00:02:43,039 --> 00:02:44,280
Time waits for no one

24
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:49,560
Now we just wait for Ji Mingxuan's sincerity

25
00:02:49,879 --> 00:02:51,599
Even if he calls the cops, we're not scared

26
00:02:52,039 --> 00:02:53,599
I already have a scapegoat lined up

27
00:02:53,599 --> 00:02:54,599
Besides

28
00:02:55,199 --> 00:02:57,919
Who in this city doesn't know
Ji Mingxuan hates The Zhou Family?

29
00:02:57,919 --> 00:03:00,520
We'll just say he's deliberately smearing us

30
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:02,000
Anyway

31
00:03:02,199 --> 00:03:04,319
Mrs. Zhou, don't we have connections on our side too?

32
00:03:08,439 --> 00:03:09,439
So do we keep him around?

33
00:03:15,280 --> 00:03:16,400
If it weren't for you

34
00:03:18,080 --> 00:03:20,680
The Zhou Family wouldn't have fallen this far

35
00:03:21,479 --> 00:03:23,000
You're the one to blame

36
00:03:23,479 --> 00:03:25,400
Tell me, don't you deserve to die?

37
00:03:29,879 --> 00:03:31,479
You're the one to blame

38
00:03:32,680 --> 00:03:34,240
Your own son won't even acknowledge you

39
00:03:35,240 --> 00:03:36,840
Working with a bastard child

40
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:37,840
Must feel great, huh?

41
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:40,439
Do you really have a death wish?

42
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:43,240
Once Ji Mingxuan's money arrives

43
00:03:43,759 --> 00:03:45,000
Have someone take him out

44
00:03:47,599 --> 00:03:49,199
So you just want money, right

45
00:03:50,439 --> 00:03:51,439
I'll give it to you

46
00:03:52,080 --> 00:03:53,199
I'll give you all of it

47
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:54,599
Mr. Ji, you need to calm down

48
00:03:54,599 --> 00:03:55,680
How can I calm down

49
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:57,280
Mo is in their hands

50
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:00,080
The assets and cash they want

51
00:04:00,159 --> 00:04:01,560
We can't process that anytime soon

52
00:04:02,599 --> 00:04:03,599
I don't care

53
00:04:03,879 --> 00:04:04,879
Find a way

54
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:06,400
Transfer whatever can be transferred

55
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:08,719
As long as they let Mo go

56
00:04:08,719 --> 00:04:10,199
If we agree to their demands

57
00:04:10,520 --> 00:04:11,960
Mr. Shen will be worthless to them

58
00:04:12,240 --> 00:04:14,400
That will put Mr. Shen in even more danger

59
00:04:32,800 --> 00:04:34,279
The people we sent to find Mo

60
00:04:35,959 --> 00:04:36,959
Any news yet

61
00:04:37,279 --> 00:04:38,599
I already sent them out to search

62
00:04:38,759 --> 00:04:39,759
We just found his car

63
00:04:40,319 --> 00:04:42,600
But we can't pinpoint where he is yet

64
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:51,879
Wait

65
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:52,959
Location

66
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:55,079
I downloaded an app on our phones

67
00:04:56,079 --> 00:04:57,079
What app

68
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:58,560
A tracking app

69
00:04:59,279 --> 00:05:00,399
So no matter where you are

70
00:05:00,399 --> 00:05:01,439
I can always see you

71
00:05:01,959 --> 00:05:03,800
And of course, you can see me too

72
00:05:04,800 --> 00:05:05,800
What

73
00:05:06,120 --> 00:05:07,279
That afraid I'll run off?

74
00:05:11,199 --> 00:05:12,800
Afraid you won't be able to find me

75
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:24,120
Did he see this day coming long ago?

76
00:05:27,279 --> 00:05:28,600
I know where Mo is

77
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:30,480
Go to the police

78
00:05:30,759 --> 00:05:31,759
Okay

79
00:05:37,800 --> 00:05:39,680
If I don't settle the Zhou Family for good

80
00:05:40,199 --> 00:05:42,319
how can I be at ease being with you?

81
00:05:43,519 --> 00:05:45,600
I won't let anyone hurt you

82
00:05:46,319 --> 00:05:47,720
Not even the slightest chance

83
00:05:53,519 --> 00:05:54,879
Watch where you're going next time

84
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:58,240
Once my hand's healed

85
00:05:58,240 --> 00:05:59,399
and I can draw again

86
00:05:59,519 --> 00:06:01,279
I'll go find a drawing job

87
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:03,040
Then I'll take care of you

88
00:06:06,600 --> 00:06:08,480
So once I become a great painter

89
00:06:08,879 --> 00:06:09,920
and start making money

90
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:12,800
I'll buy you the big house across the street

91
00:06:16,839 --> 00:06:18,079
No matter what happens

92
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:20,279
I'll always be by your side

93
00:06:21,519 --> 00:06:22,759
I'm just glad you're back

94
00:06:25,839 --> 00:06:27,399
I won't let anyone hurt you

95
00:06:30,439 --> 00:06:31,439
Anyone

96
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:50,800
Once Ji Mingxuan's shares come through

97
00:06:51,360 --> 00:06:52,360
we can take back

98
00:06:52,959 --> 00:06:54,680
everything we lost

99
00:06:55,600 --> 00:06:57,000
Don't count your chickens too early

100
00:06:57,439 --> 00:06:59,000
They're not in yet, are they?

101
00:06:59,800 --> 00:07:00,800
Besides

102
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:02,680
Don't stand so close to me

103
00:07:04,680 --> 00:07:06,399
Look how anxious Ji Mingxuan is

104
00:07:07,199 --> 00:07:08,399
It's completely in the bag

105
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:10,560
A car seems to be coming over there

106
00:07:11,639 --> 00:07:12,639
A car

107
00:07:13,439 --> 00:07:14,600
Could it be the cops?

108
00:07:15,319 --> 00:07:16,920
Why would cops be here?

109
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:17,519
Besides

110
00:07:17,839 --> 00:07:19,279
How could they be so fast?

111
00:07:20,079 --> 00:07:21,079
The cops are here

112
00:07:21,319 --> 00:07:22,319
What

113
00:07:24,279 --> 00:07:25,279
You idiot

114
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:31,120
Was this your doing

115
00:07:31,959 --> 00:07:33,480
Even if I die, I'm taking you with me

116
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:34,480
Bro

117
00:07:34,639 --> 00:07:35,439
We run now

118
00:07:35,439 --> 00:07:36,815
We can still work things out afterward

119
00:07:36,839 --> 00:07:37,639
If he ends up dead

120
00:07:37,639 --> 00:07:38,279
this blows up

121
00:07:38,279 --> 00:07:39,040
and it's a mess

122
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:40,199
You coward

123
00:07:45,879 --> 00:07:47,480
Not one of you is reliable

124
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:03,199
You'll come

125
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:04,480
You'll definitely come

126
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:05,959
You'll come

127
00:08:05,959 --> 00:08:07,079
You'll definitely come

128
00:08:08,959 --> 00:08:09,959
You'll come

129
00:08:17,319 --> 00:08:18,319
Don't come closer

130
00:08:18,439 --> 00:08:19,600
I've got Mo

131
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:20,800
Zhou Chu

132
00:08:20,839 --> 00:08:21,879
Let Mo go

133
00:08:22,199 --> 00:08:23,879
and I'll consider letting you live

134
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:26,439
You finally came

135
00:08:29,800 --> 00:08:30,839
Don't come closer

136
00:08:31,480 --> 00:08:32,480
Think carefully

137
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:34,040
You can fall into the cops' hands

138
00:08:35,759 --> 00:08:37,200
or into mine

139
00:08:44,159 --> 00:08:45,159
No need to chase them

140
00:08:46,759 --> 00:08:47,919
They won't get away

141
00:08:50,720 --> 00:08:51,720
I knew it

142
00:08:54,080 --> 00:08:55,080
You'd come

143
00:09:22,679 --> 00:09:23,679
Still playing dumb

144
00:09:30,039 --> 00:09:31,200
Now lie down like a good girl

145
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:33,360
I'm really fine now

146
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:35,240
The doctor said it's just some scrapes

147
00:09:45,200 --> 00:09:46,200
Alright

148
00:09:48,519 --> 00:09:49,799
Still, lie down for me

149
00:09:51,879 --> 00:09:52,840
Okay, okay, okay

150
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:54,799
You really went too far this time

151
00:09:55,279 --> 00:09:56,639
What if something had really happened to you

152
00:09:56,639 --> 00:09:57,679
What would I do

153
00:09:59,039 --> 00:09:59,679
Ah

154
00:09:59,679 --> 00:10:00,879
Calm down, calm down

155
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:02,200
I promise

156
00:10:02,360 --> 00:10:04,280
I won't make decisions on my own like that again

157
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:06,680
I really don't know what you were thinking

158
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:08,679
The best way to solve a problem

159
00:10:08,679 --> 00:10:10,519
Is to get rid of the person causing it

160
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:14,039
I told you I'd fight side by side with you

161
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:15,360
So

162
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:17,240
What about Mrs. Zhou and Zhou Chu

163
00:10:18,399 --> 00:10:19,399
Oh

164
00:10:19,559 --> 00:10:20,559
They got arrested

165
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:23,039
They'll probably be sentenced soon

166
00:10:23,919 --> 00:10:26,320
No matter what Mrs. Zhou pulls this time

167
00:10:27,320 --> 00:10:28,600
they're not getting away

168
00:10:29,559 --> 00:10:30,039
See

169
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:32,440
At least the ending is a good one, right

170
00:10:40,399 --> 00:10:41,399
Come on

171
00:10:46,919 --> 00:10:49,399
You knew Mrs. Zhou would use you to threaten me

172
00:10:49,919 --> 00:10:51,519
You'd already planned it all along

173
00:10:51,519 --> 00:10:53,119
that's why you put a tracker on my phone

174
00:10:53,960 --> 00:10:54,960
Not exactly

175
00:10:55,360 --> 00:10:56,879
The reason I tracked your phone

176
00:10:56,879 --> 00:10:59,399
was purely to keep tabs on your every move

177
00:11:03,240 --> 00:11:04,399
Anyway

178
00:11:05,759 --> 00:11:07,719
I didn't think they'd actually go through with it

179
00:11:08,320 --> 00:11:10,360
But this isn't my first kidnapping

180
00:11:10,360 --> 00:11:12,000
I'm an old pro by now

181
00:11:12,200 --> 00:11:13,200
But

182
00:11:13,519 --> 00:11:15,320
I didn't expect Mrs. Zhou

183
00:11:15,320 --> 00:11:16,320
to show up herself

184
00:11:17,879 --> 00:11:20,000
So I recorded all their crimes in one go

185
00:11:21,200 --> 00:11:22,399
Mrs. Zhou is cunning

186
00:11:22,960 --> 00:11:24,879
If it were just my testimony

187
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:27,320
she'd definitely twist things with the power behind her

188
00:11:27,679 --> 00:11:29,799
But this time I have ironclad audio proof

189
00:11:29,840 --> 00:11:32,399
No matter what they do, there's no way out

190
00:11:33,919 --> 00:11:34,919
Aren't you afraid they'll

191
00:11:34,919 --> 00:11:36,879
go completely crazy and do something to you?

192
00:11:37,120 --> 00:11:38,120
Hmph

193
00:11:38,399 --> 00:11:40,655
Every one of The Zhou Family
is more selfish than the last

194
00:11:40,679 --> 00:11:42,279
Saving themselves matters more than anything

195
00:11:42,279 --> 00:11:43,279
Look

196
00:11:43,320 --> 00:11:45,480
The moment the cops came, they all ran off

197
00:11:47,039 --> 00:11:48,120
Besides

198
00:11:48,480 --> 00:11:50,240
I knew you'd come save me

199
00:11:50,919 --> 00:11:51,919
You, of all people

200
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:53,920
You dared to gamble on that

201
00:11:54,639 --> 00:11:55,559
As long as you're here

202
00:11:55,559 --> 00:11:56,600
I dare anything

203
00:12:01,000 --> 00:12:02,000
Shut up

204
00:12:02,519 --> 00:12:03,519
So

205
00:12:04,519 --> 00:12:05,600
Can we now

206
00:12:05,600 --> 00:12:07,120
be together without holding back?

207
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:11,200
Of course

208
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:21,159
See, I told you

209
00:12:21,159 --> 00:12:22,200
Just minor injuries

210
00:12:22,279 --> 00:12:23,600
I'll be out of the hospital soon

211
00:12:24,360 --> 00:12:25,679
Then you'd better be careful too

212
00:12:28,679 --> 00:12:31,039
I heard he used to be a star

213
00:12:31,039 --> 00:12:31,600
Yeah

214
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:33,919
Poor guy, his sugar daddy did this to him

215
00:12:34,559 --> 00:12:35,679
Poor? Please

216
00:12:36,279 --> 00:12:38,000
He's done plenty of bad stuff before

217
00:12:38,000 --> 00:12:39,000
Ah

218
00:12:40,799 --> 00:12:42,399
That guy looks so familiar

219
00:12:43,600 --> 00:12:44,799
Could it be Zhao Yi?

220
00:12:45,720 --> 00:12:47,440
Guess you could say he got what he deserved

221
00:12:58,120 --> 00:12:59,120
Boss

222
00:13:01,000 --> 00:13:02,000
Boss

223
00:13:02,320 --> 00:13:04,639
When's the boss lady coming back?

224
00:13:04,639 --> 00:13:06,639
Didn't he say he's coming home today?

225
00:13:06,960 --> 00:13:08,799
I kinda miss him

226
00:13:09,399 --> 00:13:10,720
And here's my plan

227
00:13:11,240 --> 00:13:13,879
I'm gonna call the boss lady Mr. Ji

228
00:13:14,440 --> 00:13:16,399
And call you Mrs. Ji

229
00:13:18,559 --> 00:13:19,840
You ungrateful thing

230
00:13:19,919 --> 00:13:21,840
Who pays your salary, him or me?

231
00:13:22,480 --> 00:13:24,000
Isn't it all the same?

232
00:13:24,039 --> 00:13:25,879
You two are together anyway

233
00:13:27,720 --> 00:13:28,519
Hey

234
00:13:28,559 --> 00:13:29,440
I gotta go

235
00:13:29,519 --> 00:13:30,519
What's up?

236
00:13:33,480 --> 00:13:35,399
Mrs. Ji went to pick up Mr. Ji

237
00:13:35,600 --> 00:13:36,399
Really

238
00:13:36,600 --> 00:13:37,799
Then hurry, go go go

239
00:13:38,240 --> 00:13:39,080
Don't worry

240
00:13:39,080 --> 00:13:41,320
I'll take care of everything in this studio

241
00:13:41,840 --> 00:13:42,960
You barely come here anyway

242
00:13:43,159 --> 00:13:43,440
Mm

243
00:13:43,639 --> 00:13:43,919
Okay

244
00:13:43,960 --> 00:13:44,279
Go on

245
00:13:44,360 --> 00:13:45,120
I'm off

246
00:13:45,120 --> 00:13:46,120
Mm

247
00:13:58,919 --> 00:14:00,080
You're finally back

248
00:14:00,080 --> 00:14:01,720
Xiaoning keeps asking for Daddy every day

249
00:14:02,120 --> 00:14:03,720
Isn't her daddy right here?

250
00:14:04,639 --> 00:14:05,919
I can see it now

251
00:14:05,919 --> 00:14:07,960
You're all set to be a hands-off boss

252
00:14:09,080 --> 00:14:10,000
Hurry home

253
00:14:10,080 --> 00:14:10,960
It's been a whole day

254
00:14:10,960 --> 00:14:12,080
I'm exhausted

255
00:14:12,279 --> 00:14:13,440
I want to rest a bit

256
00:14:13,720 --> 00:14:15,679
So, want to come to my place?

257
00:14:16,519 --> 00:14:18,200
I don't think I've ever been to your place

258
00:14:18,960 --> 00:14:19,960
Where do you live?

259
00:14:20,120 --> 00:14:20,720
Let's go

260
00:14:20,720 --> 00:14:22,040
You'll find out when we get there

261
00:14:28,919 --> 00:14:31,079
Last time I was back, I didn't even get to look around

262
00:14:32,799 --> 00:14:34,200
It's changed so much

263
00:14:35,840 --> 00:14:37,840
As long as the people haven't changed, that's fine

264
00:14:40,200 --> 00:14:41,000
Mo

265
00:14:41,200 --> 00:14:42,200
Mm

266
00:14:42,399 --> 00:14:43,799
Where are you driving to?

267
00:14:43,840 --> 00:14:45,279
Why does this feel familiar?

268
00:14:46,480 --> 00:14:48,120
Just close your eyes and sleep

269
00:14:48,519 --> 00:14:49,840
You'll know when we get there

270
00:14:52,440 --> 00:14:53,440
Okay

271
00:14:54,840 --> 00:14:56,080
You're always so full of tricks

272
00:14:59,879 --> 00:15:01,080
Just drive properly

273
00:15:01,639 --> 00:15:02,159
Watch the road

274
00:15:02,600 --> 00:15:03,600
Don't look at me

275
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:06,600
Okay

276
00:15:26,480 --> 00:15:27,480
Mr. Ji

277
00:15:28,039 --> 00:15:29,039
Welcome home

278
00:15:29,840 --> 00:15:30,840
Jinxiu Mountain Villa

279
00:15:31,759 --> 00:15:32,879
Why did you bring me here?

280
00:15:34,080 --> 00:15:35,279
Did you forget, Mr. Ji?

281
00:15:36,440 --> 00:15:37,440
Back then you told Lawyer Chen

282
00:15:37,440 --> 00:15:39,639
to take back this house at Jinxiu Mountain Villa

283
00:15:40,200 --> 00:15:41,879
But I didn't agree at the time

284
00:15:44,720 --> 00:15:46,440
So the key is still in my hands

285
00:15:48,840 --> 00:15:50,240
You kept this key

286
00:15:54,960 --> 00:15:56,840
Isn't this the gift Mr. Ji gave me?

287
00:15:58,720 --> 00:15:59,720
Yes

288
00:16:00,120 --> 00:16:01,120
For you

289
00:16:11,960 --> 00:16:14,000
And you've lived here ever since

290
00:16:14,559 --> 00:16:15,559
Mm

291
00:16:16,080 --> 00:16:17,080
Ah

292
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:19,120
Ah

293
00:16:20,519 --> 00:16:21,519
Are you okay?

294
00:16:23,120 --> 00:16:24,120
I'm fine

